"use strict";export function estimateWaitSeconds({queuepos,ownqueued,runnerstatus,tier}){if(queuepos==null||runnerstatus==null||runnerstatus.stale||runnerstatus.maintenance){return null}if(ownqueued==null){return null}const runtimes=runnerstatus.typical_runtime_seconds;const numslots=runnerstatus.numslots;const queuedusers=runnerstatus.distinct_queued_users;if(!(numslots>0)||queuedusers==null){return null}const prioritytasks=runnerstatus.priority_queued_tasks??0;const priorityusers=runnerstatus.priority_queued_users??0;const inprioritytier=tier?.priority===true;const memberslots=Math.min(numslots,priorityusers);const otherusers=Math.max(1,queuedusers-priorityusers);const capacity=inprioritytier?passes=>Math.min(numslots,Math.max(1,priorityusers))*passes:passes=>Math.min(otherusers*passes,numslots*passes-Math.min(prioritytasks,memberslots*passes));const ownahead=ownqueued.filter(task=>task.position<queuepos);const otherahead=Math.max(0,tasksAhead({queuepos,tier})-ownahead.length);let ownseconds=0;for(const task of ownahead){const median=runtimes?.[task.requesttype];if(!(median>0)){return null}ownseconds+=median}let otherpasses=0;while(capacity(otherpasses+1)<=otherahead){otherpasses+=1;if(otherpasses>MAX_PASSES){return null}}let otherseconds=0;if(otherpasses>0){const meanpass=meanQueuedRuntimeSeconds(tierRequestTypes(runnerstatus,inprioritytier),runtimes);if(meanpass==null){return null}otherseconds=otherpasses*meanpass}return Math.max(ownseconds,otherseconds)}export function tasksAhead({queuepos,tier}){if(queuepos==null||!(tier?.start>0)){return queuepos}return Math.max(0,queuepos-tier.start)}const MAX_PASSES=100000;function tierRequestTypes(runnerstatus,inprioritytier){const all=runnerstatus.queued_by_request_type;const priority=runnerstatus.priority_queued_by_request_type;if(all==null||priority==null){return all}if(inprioritytier){return priority}return Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(all).map(([requesttype,count])=>[requesttype,Math.max(0,count-(priority[requesttype]??0))]))}function meanQueuedRuntimeSeconds(queuedbytype,runtimes){if(queuedbytype==null){return null}let tasks=0;let seconds=0;for(const[requesttype,count]of Object.entries(queuedbytype)){const median=runtimes?.[requesttype];if(!(count>0)||!(median>0)){continue}tasks+=count;seconds+=count*median}return tasks>0?seconds/tasks:null}export function formatWaitEstimate(seconds){if(seconds==null||!Number.isFinite(seconds)){return null}if(seconds<60){return"under a minute"}if(seconds<90*60){return"~"+Math.ceil(seconds/60)+" min"}if(seconds>=4*60*60){return"over 4 hours"}return"~"+Math.ceil(seconds/3600)+" hours"}export function formatDuration(seconds){if(seconds==null||!Number.isFinite(seconds)||seconds<0){return null}const whole=Math.round(seconds);if(whole<60){return whole+"s"}if(whole<3600){return Math.floor(whole/60)+"m "+String(whole%60).padStart(2,"0")+"s"}return Math.floor(whole/3600)+"h "+String(Math.floor(whole%3600/60)).padStart(2,"0")+"m"}
